      "content": "Changed paths for ref `34e767973e60fff9fcadf054e165085356e44f6b..23dc82206dd5f18fdc4524f55ad48286b63f5820`:\nExact reviewed-path manifest:\n- charness-artifacts/probe/2026-09-15-v8.7.1-release-observer.json\n- charness-artifacts/release-review/2026-09-15-v8.7.1-claims.md\n- charness-artifacts/release-review/2026-09-15-v8.7.1-prepared-claims-review.json\n- charness-artifacts/release/.8.7.1-prepush-quality.json.charness-receipt.json\n- charness-artifacts/release/8.7.1-prepush-quality.json\n- charness-artifacts/release/latest.md\n- docs/agent-task-runs.md\n- scripts/task_run/task_run.py\n- scripts/task_run/task_run_completion.py\n- scripts/task_run/task_run_lane_runner.py\n- tests/charness_cli/test_task_run_implementation_lane.py\n- tests/charness_cli/test_task_run_muse_executor.py\n\nOwning surfaces:\n- materialized-plugin-export: Materialized plugin export and root marketplace artifacts derived from repo-owned source paths.\n  source matches: scripts/task_run/task_run.py, scripts/task_run/task_run_completion.py, scripts/task_run/task_run_lane_runner.py\n  sync: python3 scripts/plugin_export/sync_root_plugin_manifests.py --repo-root .\n  verify: python3 scripts/plugin_export/validate_packaging.py --repo-root ., python3 -m tools.validate_packaging_committed --repo-root .\n- repo-markdown: Repo-owned markdown docs and generated markdown copies that need link, lint, and secret checks.\n  source matches: charness-artifacts/release-review/2026-09-15-v8.7.1-claims.md, charness-artifacts/release/latest.md, docs/agent-task-runs.md\n  verify: ./scripts/check-docs.sh, ./scripts/check-secrets.sh\n- operational-evidence-records: Durable issue, quality, and release evidence attachments produced by local planning and closeout workflows.\n  source matches: charness-artifacts/release/.8.7.1-prepush-quality.json.charness-receipt.json, charness-artifacts/release/8.7.1-prepush-quality.json, charness-artifacts/release/latest.md\n  verify: python3 scripts/gates/check_rel